<title>UK: World Bank sets 1.0 trln lire 2007 step-down bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 1.0 trln lire 2007 step-down bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Caboto, Cariplo, Citibank and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    ONE TRN ITL   COUPON   **9.3	 MATURITY    02.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.03    PAY DATE   S05.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.455    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES   **UNTIL 02.JAN.99 THEN STEPS DOWN TO 5.4 PCT</p>
<p>	     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.3	 SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF GLOBAL MULTICURRENCY NOTE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
